MID_SE_Oly_Jas_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Oly_Jas_C_001: How could she possibly win? Gah! Here I thought\nI'd improved.
MID_SE_Oly_Jas_C_002: Oh, what's the matter now? You've got yourself\nreally worked up there.
MID_SE_Oly_Jas_C_003: I challenged Leilidahna to a song contest—and I lost\nto her. Again!
MID_SE_Oly_Jas_C_004: No matter how many times I attempt to, I cannot\noutdo her. It's maddening!
MID_SE_Oly_Jas_C_005: Youthful pride! Getting wound up over each and\nevery single time you lose.
MID_SE_Oly_Jas_C_006: But that's natural. Surely you, too, are frustrated\nwhen you are defeated.
MID_SE_Oly_Jas_C_007: You get used to it, being a mercenary. You're gonna\nbe on the losing side of a battle now and then.
MID_SE_Oly_Jas_C_008: Why, the whole reason I became a mercenary was\nbecause the house I served ran into bad times.
MID_SE_Oly_Jas_C_009: So, you could say, defeat made me.
MID_SE_Oly_Jas_C_010: If I let myself get mad every time I didn't win,\nI'd probably fall to pieces before long.
MID_SE_Oly_Jas_C_011: I see. You've persevered through much adversity to\nsurvive as you have.
MID_SE_Oly_Jas_C_012: Still, I believe that frustration may be a crucial\ndriving force for the person who feels it.
MID_SE_Oly_Jas_C_013: It's because of that feeling that the will to fight\neffervesces within me.
MID_SE_Oly_Jas_C_014: Makes me want to try again and again, as many\ntimes as it takes. Do you not feel the same?
MID_SE_Oly_Jas_C_015: I...see your point. I'm driven by certain things too.
MID_SE_Oly_Jas_C_016: I'm bent on rebuilding my old mercenary group,\nso I can bring all my pals back together.
MID_SE_Oly_Jas_C_017: But making a living like I do, there's no time to think\nabout much but gaining more profit than loss.
MID_SE_Oly_Jas_C_018: Guess I just stow my feelings somewhere that\nthey won't get in the way.
MID_SE_Oly_Jas_C_019: Oh! But how awful.
MID_SE_Oly_Jas_C_020: I envy you, in a way. You take on challenges with\npassion, just following your heart.
MID_SE_Oly_Jas_C_021: I'd like to see you win that song contest someday.\nI'll be there cheering you on.
MID_SE_Oly_Jas_C_022: I thank you. I pray your hopes are fulfilled too.
MID_SE_Oly_Jas_C_023: And, ah—when I pray for something to happen,\nit usually does.
MID_SE_Oly_Jas_C_024: Ha! Well, isn't that peachy. Thanks for that!